+/*
+ * SPR / CPR / VAR naming rule and number
+ **********************************************
+ *    <-       SPR	 ->    <-     CPR    ->
+ *    <reserved><FREE use >    <   FREE use   >
+ * VAR#    0	1    2	  3    4    5	 6    7
