 #
-# The vendor video/mt6768/dispsys/Makefile builds the whole display core
-# (ddp_drv.o, ddp_disp_bdg.o, ddp_dsi.o, ...) and reaches for cmdq, ged,
-# staging/android/mtk_ion and dramc include paths. Only the M4U client glue is
-# ported, so only that object is built and the include list is limited to the
